<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARLOVY VARY, Czech Republic 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Czech Open women's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) beat 1-Barbara Paulus (Austria) 3-6 7-6 (7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>4-Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia) beat Emanuelle Gagliardi (Monaco) 6-0 6-7 (5-7) 6-4</p>
<p>5-Ruxanda Dragomir (Romania) beat Silvia Talaja (Croatia) 6-2 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Lenka Cenkova (Czech Rep) beat 8-Henrietta Nagyova (Slovakia) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) beat Flora Perfetti (Italy) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2.</p>
</text>
